Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.37,0:23:12.83,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord0\shad3\blur3}一旦與你四目相對  光芒便會升起
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.83,0:23:19.47,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord0\shad3\blur3}明天究竟在哪裡  地圖未標出的未來才剛要開始
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.07,0:23:23.72,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord0\shad3\blur3}就算只是孤身一人
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.72,0:23:27.98,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord0\shad3\blur3}我也正活在這重複的篇章中
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.98,0:23:31.06,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord0\shad3\blur3}缺點才是能力  孤注一擲前行
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.06,0:23:33.98,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord0\shad3\blur3}絕處逢生之火
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.81,0:23:38.49,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord0\shad3\blur3}還想再次相信
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.49,0:23:46.03,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord0\shad3\blur3}那名為清晨的希望  直到跳出循環
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.03,0:23:49.50,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord0\shad3\blur3}等著我
